<title>JAPAN: Moody's assigns Aaa rating to NTT Eurobonds.</title>
<headline>Moody's assigns Aaa rating to NTT Eurobonds.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said on Tuesday it had assigned an Aaa rating to Nippon Telegraph and Telephone Corp's (NTT) $300 million, 6.125 percent Eurobonds due 2001.</p>
</text>
